01:11:58.520 --> 01:11:59.806
You don't?
No, I don't hate you.

1207
01:11:59.880 --> 01:12:01.166
I love you so much.

1208
01:12:01.240 --> 01:12:02.605
I love you.

1209
01:12:09.240 --> 01:12:10.810
That wasn't us, Laura!

1210
01:12:10.880 --> 01:12:12.370
Laura, please.

1211
01:12:12.440 --> 01:12:15.683
It was not us, I promise you.
It wasn't us.

1212
01:12:15.760 --> 01:12:16.761
It wasn't us.

1213
01:12:20.440 --> 01:12:22.681
Please, Laura.
It wasn't us!

1214
01:12:27.280 --> 01:12:28.611
BLAIRE: I'm scared.

1215
01:12:28.680 --> 01:12:31.889
MITCH: Laura,
I promise you.

1216
01:12:46.280 --> 01:12:47.725
(BLAIRE WHIMPERING)

1217
01:13:30.480 --> 01:13:31.845
Mitch!
(GRUNTS)

1218
01:13:34.920 --> 01:13:36.160
(SCREAMING)

1219
01:13:38.160 --> 01:13:41.881
Why did you do...
Mitch? Mitch?

1220
01:13:43.160 --> 01:13:45.481
Mitch!

1221
01:13:45.720 --> 01:13:47.370
(MUSIC PLAYING)

1222
01:13:48.040 --> 01:13:49.166
What?

1223
01:13:49.800 --> 01:13:51.529
Guys, I'm so sorry!

1224
01:13:51.600 --> 01:13:55.207
Why did you do that?
What... Who was...

1225
01:14:00.600 --> 01:14:01.601
What?

1226
01:14:03.080 --> 01:14:04.320
What?

1227
01:14:07.040 --> 01:14:08.610
(TIMER COUNTING DOWN)

1228
01:14:11.880 --> 01:14:15.805
No, no, no.
Why are you still counting down?

1229
01:14:15.880 --> 01:14:17.041
Why are you...

1230
01:14:18.520 --> 01:14:20.887
What do you want from me?

1231
01:14:21.280 --> 01:14:23.521
What do you think I did?

1232
01:14:25.040 --> 01:14:26.644
(BLAIRE SNIFFLING)

1233
01:14:31.200 --> 01:14:33.646
We were sisters, Laura.
Don't you know it?

1234
01:14:33.720 --> 01:14:35.609
I loved you.

1235
01:14:35.680 --> 01:14:37.091
Look.

1236
01:14:38.560 --> 01:14:41.245
Look at us.
No, look at us. Look!

1237
01:14:41.320 --> 01:14:42.321
Look at us.

1238
01:14:44.040 --> 01:14:47.487
Do you remember that?
Do you remember that?

1239
01:14:52.080 --> 01:14:54.890
I'm so sorry we drifted apart.

1240
01:15:02.000 --> 01:15:03.081
What?

1241
01:15:09.040 --> 01:15:10.451
(COUNTDOWN STOPS)

1242
01:15:16.440 --> 01:15:17.805
No!

1243
01:15:44.840 --> 01:15:46.365
<i>I got her.</i> (LAUGHING)

1244
01:15:46.880 --> 01:15:48.405
I'm sorry.

1245
01:16:28.160 --> 01:16:29.810
(DOOR CREAKING)

1246
01:16:31.960 --> 01:16:33.291
BLAIRE: No!

1247
01:16:34.960 --> 01:16:36.121
(SOFTLY) Laura?

1248
01:16:36.640 --> 01:16:37.641
(SCREAMING)
